# Tel frontend: a signal-backed counter using the call-style view DSL.
# Build for the browser with: tel build examples/web.tel --target web
# Build/SSR in Node with:    tel build examples/web.tel --target web
# Top-level bindings in a `web fn` become signals in web target output; reads
# re-render and `n += 1` inside an event handler updates the DOM.
web fn App():
  n = 0
  div(class="app",
    h1("Counter ", n),
    button(onclick=() => n += 1, "+"))
